OL,3,GNEWSASophie's double life-saving gift
OL,4,Ato a stranger and science
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Sophie signed up to a UK stem cell
OL,7,Fdonor register, she never expected to
OL,8,Fbe called so quickly to help save a
OL,9,Flife.
OL,11,FJust months later, the 21-year-old
OL,12,Fdiscovered she was a match for a
OL,13,Fstranger in need of a stem cell
OL,14,Ftransplant to treat a blood cancer or
OL,15,Fblood disorder.
OL,17,F"I was so happy," she said. "It's such
OL,18,Fan honour to get the call and be able
OL,19,Fto help someone."
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
