OL,3,GNEWSASophie's double life-saving gift
OL,4,Ato a stranger and science
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring a donation session lasting
OL,7,Fseveral hours, millions of stem cells
OL,8,Fwere collected from her blood at the
OL,9,FAnthony Nolan Cell Collection Centre
OL,10,F(ANCCC) in Nottingham.
